[
  {
    "id": "247cd75b905132b50d44",
    "source": "A check names what it is about in about, creature and terrain (tracking the undead is about \"tracking\" with creature \"undead\"; the gate's stonework is about \"stonework\"): the server applies Favored Enemy, Natural Explorer, Stonecunning, Artificer's Lore, Stone Camouflage and Supreme Sneak from them. Subclass features are resolved by the server too: spend one with use_resource by its own name (Kensei's Shot, Shadow Step, Symbiotic Entity, Visage of the Astral Self, Sharpen the Blade with amount, Touch of the Long Death with amount and targetEnemyId, Hound of Ill Omen, Psychic Blades, Unsettling Words, Versatile Trickster and Insightful Fighting with targetEnemyId, Fanatical Focus, Elder Champion, Dread Lord...). A subclass choice (Totem Spirit, Aspect of the Beast, Totemic Attunement, Transmuter's Stone, Elemental Gift, Armor Model) is made once with use_resource and the option as the variant, outside a fight.",
    "sourceHash": "247cd75b905132b50d44173a391313116ffc92b1a24a9a8907eafe39be3c6d7c",
    "kinds": [
      "display-property"
    ],
